  displayName: Dryad
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a072c5e1ea9a44e43b8bf28eebff0d12, type: 3}
  description: A dryad is a medium-sized fae bound to the wild - tall as a person,
    with bark-like skin and leaf-shadowed hair. It moves with a measured stride,
    never hurried. Dryads are silent - they do not speak aloud - communicating only
    through presence, gesture, and the sudden stillness of the woods around them.
